                <note rend="inline" type="source">462.00R296/5247: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Latvia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Cole</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-10-28T16:00:00+02:00">October 28, 1931—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 28—12:25 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>46. Department’s 38, October 24, 2 p.m. Latvian Government accepts
                    unconditionally. Despatch follows.<anchor n="24" xml:id="d183-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cole</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
